    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming adventures with your friends. Explore snowy landscapes, play mini-games, and express yourself in the cutest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7577ec3aee4d96d16d85df0f09abacb8.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waddle through snowy villages, slide down icy hills, or give your friends a playful slap to send them tumbling. It\u2019s all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7c192a77c225b7125f5b43342d382089.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7c192a77c225b7125f5b43342d382089.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7c192a77c225b7125f5b43342d382089.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/bbc425e6d62fb871bdd6670abf81483b.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and relax as you fish in icy waters. Catch rare creatures, fill your journal, and earn rewards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/124e423f81fbec973a3d4c25b7819313.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/124e423f81fbec973a3d4c25b7819313.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/124e423f81fbec973a3d4c25b7819313.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/c244607d4fa9e9c1c2b0f32b5382f6cc.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits, colors, hats, and accessories to create your own unique penguin style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/be0821b1a85f57ef499b03b46572df2b.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/be0821b1a85f57ef499b03b46572df2b.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/be0821b1a85f57ef499b03b46572df2b.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/6814b81e15696eb0209e57911202251e.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather around the campfire, dance, emote, or just vibe with friends in a warm and snowy social hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/d0a17b56f7a4b779892d4095f526ae14.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/d0a17b56f7a4b779892d4095f526ae14.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/d0a17b56f7a4b779892d4095f526ae14.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming adventures with your friends. Explore snowy landscapes, play mini-games, and express yourself in the cutest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7577ec3aee4d96d16d85df0f09abacb8.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waddle through snowy villages, slide down icy hills, or give your friends a playful slap to send them tumbling. It\u2019s all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7c192a77c225b7125f5b43342d382089.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7c192a77c225b7125f5b43342d382089.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/7c192a77c225b7125f5b43342d382089.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/bbc425e6d62fb871bdd6670abf81483b.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and relax as you fish in icy waters. Catch rare creatures, fill your journal, and earn rewards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/124e423f81fbec973a3d4c25b7819313.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/124e423f81fbec973a3d4c25b7819313.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/124e423f81fbec973a3d4c25b7819313.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/c244607d4fa9e9c1c2b0f32b5382f6cc.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock outfits, colors, hats, and accessories to create your own unique penguin style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/be0821b1a85f57ef499b03b46572df2b.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/be0821b1a85f57ef499b03b46572df2b.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/be0821b1a85f57ef499b03b46572df2b.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/6814b81e15696eb0209e57911202251e.webp?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather around the campfire, dance, emote, or just vibe with friends in a warm and snowy social hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/d0a17b56f7a4b779892d4095f526ae14.poster.avif?t=1755443120\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/d0a17b56f7a4b779892d4095f526ae14.webm?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/d0a17b56f7a4b779892d4095f526ae14.mp4?t=1755443120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
